# Rust
examples/rust/target/

# Build artifacts. Generated *source* under examples/proto/generated is
# committed on purpose — it is what a consumer sees the plugin produce — so it
# must not be ignored, or a newly generated file is silently left untracked and
# CI fails on a file that exists only on the author's machine.
**/build
**/target
examples/cpp/server

# Bazel Ignore
bazel-*